# Third-party art packs. These are the *source* archives the importer reads,
# not build output: 283 MB and growing, re-downloadable from the urls in
# docs/ASSET_SOURCING.md, and verifiable against the sha256 recorded for each
# in docs/ASSET_LICENCES.md. What ships is the handful of normalised files
# the importer writes into public/models/, which are checked in.
assets/*.zip
